    Muhai-san, you asked me to leave you notes since you''re
    having memory problems. In case you forgot where the keys to the mine are, take
    a good look at the picture and you''ll remember. Yesterday (04.23) strange noises
    started coming from the mine in sector B2. Probably another cave-in.

'
